<body>
<a class="skip" href="#content">Skip to content</a>
<main class="shell" id="content">
<nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Cockpit"><a href="/">Jobs</a><a href="/parent/">Parent</a><a href="/dispensary/" aria-current="page">Dispensary</a><a href="/dispensary/learned">Learned</a></nav>
<header class="top"><div><h1>Dispensary prices</h1><p class="intro">Menu prices, recorded discounts, and availability in one place.</p><p class="updated" id="meta" aria-live="polite">Loading snapshots…</p></div><button id="theme" type="button">Dark mode</button></header>
<div class="actions"><button id="reload" type="button">Refresh data</button></div>
<div id="status" class="status" role="status">Loading price data…</div>
<section class="summary" id="summary" aria-label="Latest snapshot summary"></section>
<details class="card" id="limits"><summary>Data limits &amp; price definitions</summary><ul>
<li>No stock counts. “In stock” means the item is on the online menu.</li><li>Weedmaps deal coverage is incomplete. Harvest’s own-site deals are not readable by this collector.</li><li>In-store-only deals come from manual entries in data/manual.json.</li><li>Listed is the menu price; original is the pre-sale price. After-tax is the scout’s estimate (excise + sales tax, excluding first-visit promotions), not a checkout quote.</li><li>Size parsing retains the existing g/gram/ml name matching; ml is not a verified mass measurement. No currency conversion or new tax calculation is applied.</li></ul></details>
<div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Price views"><button id="tab-base" data-t="base" role="tab" aria-controls="base" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">Base prices</button><button id="tab-deals" data-t="deals" role="tab" aria-controls="deals" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Deals</button><button id="tab-buy" data-t="buy" role="tab" aria-controls="buy" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Buy planner</button><button id="tab-half" data-t="half" role="tab" aria-controls="half" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">0.5g value</button></div>
<div class="card"><div class="row"><label>Type <select id="typ"><option value="">All types</option><option>disposable</option><option>pod</option><option>cart</option><option>other</option></select></label><label>Min size (g) <select id="sz"><option value="0">any</option><option value="0.5">0.5+</option><option value="1">1+</option><option value="2">2+</option></select></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="lowthc">Include items under 75% THC</label></div><p class="note">Type and size filter base prices, deals, and summary cards. The THC control also affects the existing planner. Size comparisons use the latest snapshot’s supplied half-value data.</p></div>
<section id="base" class="tab on" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-base"><div class="chartgrid"><article class="card"><h2>Lowest base price per item</h2><p class="note">Original price, falling back to listed price.</p><div id="c1" class="chart"></div></article><article class="card"><h2>Lowest base price per gram</h2><p class="note">For items with a parsed size.</p><div id="c2" class="chart"></div></article></div><article class="card"><h2>Today by store</h2><table id="bt"></table></article></section>
<section id="deals" class="tab" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-deals" hidden><div class="chartgrid"><article class="card"><h2>Share of items on sale</h2><p class="note">Listed below original, by snapshot.</p><div id="c3" class="chart"></div></article><article class="card"><h2>Average sale discount</h2><p class="note">Percentage off original price, sale items only.</p><div id="c4" class="chart"></div></article></div><article class="card"><h2>Store announcements &amp; volume deals</h2><div id="ann" class="announcements"></div></article><article class="card"><h2>Deepest discounts &amp; manual deals</h2><p class="note">Up to 15 scout discounts from the latest snapshot, plus dated manual entries. Manual entries are not automatically current.</p><table id="dt"></table></article></section>
<section id="buy" class="tab" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-buy" hidden><article class="card"><h2>Planner assumptions</h2><p class="note">Existing v1 model: user-stated baselines and unmeasured restock priors. After-tax values are estimates. Unknown THC is kept and marked; known values below 75% are excluded unless enabled above.</p><div class="row"><label>Grams per 2 weeks <input id="u2w" type="number" min="0.1" step="0.1" value="2.8"></label><label>Extra use per extra unit (%) <input id="upl" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="10"></label><label>Spend target / 2 weeks ($) <input id="tgt" type="number" min="0" value="42"></label><label>Max one-time purchase ($) <input id="cap" type="number" min="0" value="50"></label></div></article><article class="card"><h2>Cheap-brand watchlist</h2><table id="wl"></table><p class="note">The existing model uses Cizi 30-day and Madlabs/Threddy 21-day restock priors, not measured recurrence. Default use is 2.8g per 14 days. Its unit-based coverage formula is retained; coverage can be misleading for non-1g units.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Fallback: cheapest available now</h2><table id="fb"></table></article></section>
<section id="half" class="tab" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-half" hidden><article class="card"><h2>0.5g comparison</h2><p class="note">Two 0.5g units versus one 1g unit at the same store, using supplied after-tax estimates. Rec-only stores remain labeled comparison data.</p><div id="hcall" class="status"></div></article><article class="card"><h2>Same product in both sizes</h2><table id="hpairs"></table></article><article class="card"><h2>Cheapest sizes by type</h2><table id="htypes"></table></article></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Menu availability</h2><p id="reg" class="note">Loading registry…</p></section>
<noscript><p class="status error">Enable JavaScript to load the existing JSON data and use filters.</p></noscript>
</main>
<script>
'use strict';
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),arr=v=>Array.isArray(v)?v.filter(x=>x&&typeof x==='object'):[],obj=v=>v&&typeof v==='object'&&!Array.isArray(v)?v:{},text=v=>v==null?'':String(v);
const num=v=>v==null||typeof v==='boolean'||String(v).trim()===''||!Number.isFinite(Number(v))?null:Number(v);
const money=v=>num(v)==null?'—':'$'+num(v).toFixed(2),avg=a=>a.length?Number((a.reduce((x,y)=>x+y,0)/a.length).toFixed(2)):null,mn=a=>a.length?Number(a.reduce((x,y)=>Math.min(x,y),Infinity).toFixed(2)):null;
